  "description": "<p>Touch; inscribe a rune on a surface or object (the rune is visible, 3ft across); choose one type. It triggers when read, touched or passed over (your choice); everything within a 30ft radius is affected; Will negates. Fear: Frightened 1 minute. Hopelessness: Incapacitated 1 minute. Insanity: attacks the nearest creature for 1 minute. Pain: Disadvantage on attacks and checks 1 hour. Sleep: Unconscious 3 minutes (Level 8 or lower). Stunning: Stunned 1d6 rounds. Lasts until triggered or dispelled. Material: powdered diamond and opal worth 5,000 gp, consumed.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Costly component:</strong> see Rare Spell Components in the Shopkeeper's Catalogue.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric, Illusionist</p>",
